# Up and Down (or ^P and ^N) in the prompt go through the searches made; what was typed is kept.
args: text.txt
file text.txt:
| one two three
keys: {^W}one{Enter}
keys: {^W}two{Enter}
keys: {^W}three{Enter}
keys: {^W}zz
keys: {Up}
keys: {Up}
keys: {^P}
keys: {Up}
keys: {Down}
keys: {^N}
keys: {Down}
keys: {Down}
keys: {Enter}
keys: {^X}
